{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o041b","title":"刘备破刘璋诸将并受李严降","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o041b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘璋诸将在涪败退绵竹，李严督绵竹军后率众降刘备。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-a-p038-fucheng","label":"《益部耆旧杂记》","text":"《益部耆旧杂记》记张任、刘璝在涪败退，与刘循同守雒城。","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p038-fucheng"]},{"id":"liuliao-a-8336e0c7b0b844544758","label":"正文","text":"建安十八年严率众降先主拜裨将军","evidence":["liuliao-q-bff53060b5c21dc2f8b9"]},{"id":"huowang-a-3a6ff661ef31c5b5b5ee","label":"正文","text":"费诗举城降刘备","evidence":["huowang-q-aa9daafd244650a509ad"]},{"id":"dengzhang-a-8423036e1b270c09a0ba","label":"正文","text":"费观拒先主于绵竹后降","evidence":["dengzhang-q-3b1cd3ca2791ffff16c8"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"破军受降","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0253","role":"遣军","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0053","role":"拒守","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0054","role":"拒守","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0055","role":"拒守","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0056","role":"拒守","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0057","role":"率众降","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0066","role":"据《益部耆旧杂记》拒守败退","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p038-fucheng"]},{"person":"huowang-p0030","role":"先举城降","evidence":["huowang-q-aa9daafd244650a509ad"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0063","role":"建安十八年参李严军，拒先主于绵竹，与严俱降","evidence":["dengzhang-q-3b1cd3ca2791ffff16c8"]}],"place":{"text":"涪、绵竹","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"]},"time":{"label":"进据涪城后","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o041b-q"],"after":"xianzhu-e-o041a"},"source_order":[32,167,"O041b"],"order":6561}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0053","name":"冷苞","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o041"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o041-xianzhu-p0053","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o041"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-3b1cd3ca2791ffff16c8","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-edd49427946d69daf035","layer":"original","quote":"观建安十八年参李严军，拒先主于绵竹，与严俱降","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":49},{"id":"huowang-q-aa9daafd244650a509ad","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-20cf9e4bd23391868d15","layer":"original","quote":"先主攻绵竹时，诗先举城降","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":33},{"id":"liuliao-q-bff53060b5c21dc2f8b9","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-c85321149a539f796ae2","layer":"original","quote":"建安十八年，署严为护军，拒先主于绵竹。严率众降先主，先主拜严裨将军","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o041b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c205af65c5b891e6a027","layer":"original","quote":"璋遣刘z 、冷苞、张任、邓贤〔、吴懿〕等拒先主于涪；﹝三﹞皆破败，退保绵竹。璋复遣李严督绵竹诸军〖12〗，严率众降先主。先主军益强，分遣诸将平下属县。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":76,"end":151},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o041","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c205af65c5b891e6a027","layer":"original","quote":"先主大怒，召璋白水军督杨怀，责以无礼，斩之。乃使黄忠、卓膺勒兵向璋〖9〗。先主径至关中〖10〗，质诸将并士卒妻子〖11〗；引兵与忠、膺等进到涪，据其城。璋遣刘z 、冷苞、张任、邓贤〔、吴懿〕等拒先主于涪；﹝三﹞皆破败，退保绵竹。璋复遣李严督绵竹诸军〖12〗，严率众降先主。先主军益强，分遣诸将平下属县。诸葛亮、张飞、赵云等将兵溯流定白帝、江州、江阳〖13〗，唯关羽留镇荆州。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":187},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p038-fucheng","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8aa718c2e93c0cc7db20","layer":"pei","quote":"刘璋遣张任、刘璝，率精兵拒捍先主于涪；为先主所破，退与璋子循守雒城。","attribution":"《益部耆旧杂记》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-9652930478437e755980","start":14,"end":48}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
